# Hangedman snake pattern is a source Snake vault.
# The extra tag allows another ordinary Snake map after this one fits.
# Source default-depth: Snake is made explicit for this separate file.
NAME: hangedman_snake_pattern
DEPTH: Snake
TAGS:    transparent extra
# Pillars, door positions, entrances.
SHUFFLE: XYZ, aA-+ / aA-+ / aA-+ / Aa+- / Aa+-, ABCDE
SUBST:   X : cx.., Y : cx...., Z = ., a = x, - : xx+, + : +++..
SUBST:   A : @@+, B : @@++..x, C : @+...xxx, DE = x
MAP
   xxBxxxxxxxCxxxxxxxDxxxxxxxxExxxxxx
  xx...xx.........xx...xx.........xx
 xx.....xx.......xx.....xx.......xx
aa...X...xx..Z..--...X...xx..Z..aa
 AA...Y...++..Y..++...Y...++..Y..AA
  xx...Z...--..X..xx...Z...--..X..xx
   xx.....xx.......xx.....xx.......xx
    xx...xx.........xx...xx.........xx
     xxExxxxxxDxxxxxxxxCxxxxxxBxxxxxxx
ENDMAP
